{"bangumi":{"date":"1994-01-07","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/f6/53/10409_OnW1o.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/f6/53/10409_OnW1o.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/f6/53/10409_OnW1o.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/f6/53/10409_OnW1o.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/f6/53/10409_OnW1o.jpg"},"summary":"　　恰恰是一個戴著小紅帽的見習小魔女，與魔法師傅聖洛威住在摩奇摩奇山上。當恰恰與好朋友阿力和希尼一起用魔法飾物，恰恰就能變身成魔法公主。\r\n\r\n　　恰恰其實是國王及王后的女兒，大魔王在恰恰幼年時攻擊城堡，把國王和王后變成石像，恰恰則被塞拉維救走了。大魔王亦被恰恰的爺爺的魔法所困，不能離開城堡，只能派手下追尋恰恰下落，但那些手下每次都被魔法公主打敗。最後恰恰和朋友們進入城堡打敗大魔王，國王和王后回復為人。後來恰恰和朋友們為了保護世界，以三件魔法飾物封印「黑暗之門」，從此恰恰不能再變成魔法公主，但仍可以用另一些魔法物品施行魔法。","name":"赤ずきんチャチャ","name_cn":"小红帽恰恰","tags":[{"name":"TV","count":51,"total_count":1407685},{"name":"童年","count":46,"total_count":93196},{"name":"1994","count":37,"total_count":4255},{"name":"魔法少女","count":33,"total_count":36876},{"name":"小红帽恰恰","count":32,"total_count":32},{"name":"漫画改","count":21,"total_count":864901},{"name":"魔法","count":15,"total_count":20073},{"name":"经典","count":13,"total_count":23155},{"name":"校园","count":11,"total_count":455057},{"name":"彩花珉","count":9,"total_count":9},{"name":"搞笑","count":7,"total_count":640415},{"name":"辻初樹","count":6,"total_count":42},{"name":"ATV","count":6,"total_count":79},{"name":"日本","count":5,"total_count":298781},{"name":"童年TvT","count":4,"total_count":199},{"name":"山田隆司","count":4,"total_count":212},{"name":"StudioGallop","count":4,"total_count":459},{"name":"大地丙太郎","count":3,"total_count":3434},{"name":"ぎゃろっぷ","count":3,"total_count":263},{"name":"奇幻","count":3,"total_count":473181},{"name":"鈴木真仁","count":2,"total_count":6},{"name":"GALLOP","count":2,"total_count":66},{"name":"樱井弘明","count":2,"total_count":864},{"name":"1994年","count":2,"total_count":229},{"name":"漫改","count":2,"total_count":361997},{"name":"变身","count":2,"total_count":1665},{"name":"香取慎吾","count":2,"total_count":3},{"name":"大长篇","count":1,"total_count":650},{"name":"神搞笑","c